A struct the lens writes empty, whose fields the target requires and the
source does not have: the fields are reported together where they are
missing, inside the struct the author wrote, rather than the struct as if it
were not written.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta: {
		owner: string
		team:  string
	}
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		meta: {}
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta: {
		owner: string
		team:  string
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0346]: ForwardLens produces nothing for meta.owner and meta.team, which v1.0 requires
  --> history/1.0.thema:12:3
   |
12 |         meta: {}
   |         ^^^^
   |
   = help: add owner: <mapping>, team: <mapping> to v1_0.meta
